```css
@media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 560px) {
  #stage-wrap { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  #touch {
    position: fixed; ... margin: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: none; box-shadow: none; padding-top: 0; justify-content: flex-end;
  }
}
```
Also in landscape, stage-wrap flex 0 0 auto from the touch media → stage would be at top, not filling. Set flex:1 1 auto.

